 fifth grade, except incidentally along with vocational training. The system was geared in effect to produce a supply of general laborers and domestic servants who understood the Japanese language, plus a small elite of skilled laborers and petty officials.\'  It is unclear from this description whether native officals were employed on a part-time or full-time basis. We have assumed full-time for the time being.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 881, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 798})
